    bullets: ['Horizontal measures apply across every EEE category at once rather than one product group at a time — a phone, a washing machine, and an industrial control panel land under the same 2029 requirement instead of separate delegated acts', 'Repairability (2027) and recycled-content/recyclability (2029) are two separate horizontal measures with two separate adoption dates; planning against one covers only half of what applies to electronics', 'The record model AuthiChain already issues for steel’s embodied-carbon data and batteries’ recycled-content field carries over — adding an EEE recyclability figure is a new field in credentialSubject, not a new record type'],
